Unguarded metadata reads then packed scope all/local/npm-exec/global. Local branch creates native/scanner/provider/extension fixtures and probes installed CLI; other branches run exec/global install. Finally cleanup may warn only for specified Windows errors. if (scripts/test-packed-cli.mjs:421): scope === "all" || scope === "local". assert.deepEqual check ["JSON.parse(readFileSync(resolve(consumer, "agent", "keybindings.json"), "utf8"))", "{
			"app.message.followUp": "ctrl+enter",
			"app.message.dequeue": "ctrl+up",
		}"]. No custom message; Node owns default diagnostic wording/value formatting.
